Coordinator: Orca final status.
- **Merge:** refix2, placeholder layout, help-probe override and README landed as 964e0b6. The merge review found 2 rollback defects, fixed as e35097d. 350 recovery tests pass and typecheck passes.
- **Visual-proof hold.** Screening found that 8 of 9 rendered QA screenshots show the real macOS username and hostname in a background terminal's shell prompt; two also show a real home path.
  - Nothing was published. The images exist only in the gitignored local run directory.
  - The one clean image was committed on an orphan branch (~/.claude/worktrees/orca/xmr-visual-proof @ 63f5e9a). Pushing that branch to the fork was denied by the Claude Code permission classifier. It was not retried and not worked around; the worktree stays unpushed.
- **Workflow wf_df21506a-fe2 stopped** before drafting a PR body around missing proof.
- **Replacement run wf_2914c8b1-ae4:**
  - hermetic shell environment for every launched app;
  - an automated guard that fails any screenshot whose page or terminal text contains the username, hostname or home path;
  - re-render and visual screening, then code review;
  - a template PR body with no local paths;
  - one draft-PR attempt to stablyai/orca. A denial becomes a final gate for the user.
- **Image hosting:** listed as a final user gate (approve the proof-branch push, or attach the regenerated images manually).
